flowchart TD
  A[Family creates account] --> B[Instruction screen, fields hidden]
  B --> C[Family selects time buckets per day]
  C --> D[Submit]
  D --> E{Validation runs after submit}
  E -->|enough availability| F[Availability record stored]
  E -->|short| G[Coach family through what is missing]
  G --> C
  F --> H[Bucket expanded to candidate intervals]
  H --> I{Enough hours for recommended dose}
  I -->|no| J[Operations queue, human contact]
  I -->|yes| K[Therapist search across capacity and service area]
  K --> L[Schedule built and offered]
  L --> M{Family accepts}
  M -->|no| N[Rework schedule within same buckets]
  N --> L
  M -->|yes| O[Assignment locked, first session set]
  F --> P[Funnel reporting]
  J --> P
  O --> P
  P --> Q[Rule tuning and design iteration]
  Q --> B
  O --> R[Availability change event]
  R --> F
